# Formsubmit endpoint hash for the Contact form.
# Activation:
#   1. Submit once to https://formsubmit.co/<your-email> (raw form or curl).
#   2. Click the confirmation link Formsubmit emails you.
#   3. The dashboard / response gives you a random hash like "abcdef123456".
#   4. Paste it below (NOT your raw email — the hash hides it from scrapers).
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value.
VITE_FORMSUBMIT_KEY=
